WEBVTT

00:02:19.960 --> 00:02:21.450
Will...

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:25.610
Will...

00:02:26.620 --> 00:02:28.260
Brother...

00:03:16.540 --> 00:03:19.220
That's toward my house!

00:03:19.220 --> 00:03:22.390
This ain't no joke! At this 
rate my house is a goner, too!

00:03:22.390 --> 00:03:24.480
What the hell is the government doing?

00:03:25.240 --> 00:03:27.480
Let me introduce you, Mr. President.

00:03:27.930 --> 00:03:34.000
He is a director at Generas Industries 
in charge of weapons development.

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:35.740
Doctor Minami.

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:38.770
Generas, you say?

00:03:38.770 --> 00:03:39.670
Correct.

00:03:39.670 --> 00:03:44.550
He is currently in charge of a project 
developing weaponry for the army.

00:03:44.550 --> 00:03:49.340
I see. I understand who you are now, Dr. Minami.

00:03:49.340 --> 00:03:51.060
Let's hear what you have to say.

00:03:51.060 --> 00:03:55.140
I will cut to the chase, Mr. President.

00:03:57.190 --> 00:04:00.680
I want you to call off the nuclear strike!

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:19.910
As we figured, it won't be so 
easy to get close to their base.

00:04:25.730 --> 00:04:28.540
I wonder if we can keep going 
without being discovered?

00:04:28.540 --> 00:04:30.160
How's it going, Professor?

00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:33.050
It's definitely impossible if 
you approach it normally...

00:04:33.050 --> 00:04:35.550
Then, wait a second! What are we...

00:04:38.020 --> 00:04:42.840
Worry not! That's why I took the 
time to come up with a new plan!

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:45.480
"Be Prepared," or so they say.

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:50.730
Um... Hmm, was this the right way?

00:04:50.730 --> 00:04:53.540
I am <i>so</i> not reassured...

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:56.100
I'm sure this is it! Over here.

00:04:59.810 --> 00:05:01.370
A dead-end.

00:05:01.760 --> 00:05:03.080
I knew it.

00:05:03.080 --> 00:05:05.730
Well, this is the Professor we're talking about.

00:05:05.730 --> 00:05:07.540
No. This is right.

00:05:07.940 --> 00:05:10.240
What are you planning on doing?

00:05:13.890 --> 00:05:15.530
Here it is!

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:18.990
First the subways, and now the sewer system!

00:05:18.990 --> 00:05:21.470
Using these would should be 
able to approach their base

00:05:21.470 --> 00:05:23.490
without encountering the enemy!

00:05:29.240 --> 00:05:30.480
Thanks for waiting.

00:05:31.540 --> 00:05:33.490
Now, shall we?

00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:44.910
They have demonstrated 
some impressive abilities.

00:05:44.910 --> 00:05:48.400
It is not so uncommon for developing planets.

00:05:48.400 --> 00:05:53.120
Although it is clear they 
are a barbaric species...

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:56.040
Is that what is making them so hard to control?

00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:59.630
Yes. These subjects are 
causing us much difficulty

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:02.550
due to the varied emotions 
that coexist within them.

00:06:15.670 --> 00:06:19.410
Test Subjects 01 and 02, can you hear me?

00:06:19.410 --> 00:06:21.450
Yes, Lord Kogorr...

00:06:21.450 --> 00:06:24.030
I can hear you well, my Lord!

00:06:24.030 --> 00:06:26.170
How do you feel?

00:06:28.290 --> 00:06:29.910
Incredible!

00:06:31.040 --> 00:06:32.880
Oh? Incredible you say?

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:36.740
Yes! I can feel power 
flowing throughout my body!

00:06:36.740 --> 00:06:38.670
I want to fight soon!

00:06:38.670 --> 00:06:40.240
Don't be hasty.

00:06:40.240 --> 00:06:44.510
When they show themselves, you 
can go at them all you want.

00:06:44.510 --> 00:06:48.970
I thank you for the opportunity, Lord Kogorr!

00:06:48.970 --> 00:06:53.600
So what are you talking about, Dr... um...

00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:54.920
Minami.

00:06:54.920 --> 00:06:58.580
Exactly what I said, Mr. President.

00:06:58.580 --> 00:07:02.100
Do you even understand what that would mean?

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:03.300
Of course.

00:07:03.300 --> 00:07:09.370
Then do you realize the number of victims 
we'll have if we don't use a nuclear strike?

00:07:10.270 --> 00:07:11.570
But a pittance!

00:07:11.830 --> 00:07:13.580
This is no laughing matter!

00:07:13.580 --> 00:07:16.720
It's my duty to protect the homeland!

00:07:16.720 --> 00:07:21.690
Do you think I can just abandon 
the citizens in a time of crisis?

00:07:21.690 --> 00:07:23.270
And not just that!

00:07:23.270 --> 00:07:27.250
The sphere is heading for the White House!

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:30.050
The White House? Perfect.

00:07:30.050 --> 00:07:32.680
Let's give it that much.

00:07:33.790 --> 00:07:37.060
You can rebuild as many 
White Houses as you want,

00:07:37.060 --> 00:07:40.300
but there's only five of those 
weapons in the entire world!

00:07:40.300 --> 00:07:43.660
Are you saying that sphere is more 
important than the White House?

00:07:43.660 --> 00:07:46.530
Please think about this logically.

00:07:46.530 --> 00:07:49.430
The balance of power in the world
will be drastically altered

00:07:49.430 --> 00:07:52.480
depending on what happens
to those spheres.

00:07:52.480 --> 00:07:54.760
Haven't you considered what might happen

00:07:54.760 --> 00:07:58.620
if another country obtained one
while the United States did not?

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:04.800
The United States of America must 
always remain number one in the world!

00:08:04.800 --> 00:08:05.920
Isn't that right?

00:08:07.560 --> 00:08:11.300
It's up to you whether to 
think of this as a crisis,

00:08:11.510 --> 00:08:13.800
or an opportunity...

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:15.200
Watch yourself!

00:08:15.640 --> 00:08:17.970
Do you have some sort of plan?

00:08:17.970 --> 00:08:22.680
I've been waiting for you to 
say those words, Mr. President!

00:08:37.780 --> 00:08:39.500
Professor...

00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:45.440
You've prepared for something like this, 
right? You took this into account, right?

00:08:47.240 --> 00:08:48.540
Joey...

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:50.850
This is a job for Heroman!

00:08:57.180 --> 00:09:01.160
Okay? Do it nice and slow, and 
try not to make much noise...

00:09:01.160 --> 00:09:01.990
Right.

00:09:02.710 --> 00:09:05.350
Heroman... Attack.

00:09:18.710 --> 00:09:21.670
I wonder if that's okay?

00:09:23.550 --> 00:09:25.750
Doesn't look like we've been discovered.

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:26.960
Let's move on.

00:09:45.790 --> 00:09:46.980
There's a light...

00:09:47.460 --> 00:09:48.990
Quiet!

00:09:48.990 --> 00:09:51.310
Let's be careful from here on.

00:09:58.700 --> 00:10:00.830
Professor, come here!

00:10:01.700 --> 00:10:04.360
I said to be quiet!

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:06.300
This is...

00:10:25.320 --> 00:10:27.610
Okay, let's review.

00:10:27.610 --> 00:10:29.700
We have three goals.

00:10:29.700 --> 00:10:32.570
First, destroy the sphere control system.

00:10:32.570 --> 00:10:34.750
Second, rescue Will and Nick.

00:10:34.750 --> 00:10:37.240
And finally, destroy this factory.

00:10:37.240 --> 00:10:43.230
It bears repeating, but I don't think we
should force trying to accomplish all three.

00:10:43.230 --> 00:10:46.590
Just completing one would be excellent.

00:10:47.440 --> 00:10:50.950
However, there is one thing 
I hope you understand.

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:56.680
There isn't much time until the 
sphere reaches the White House.

00:10:56.680 --> 00:11:00.560
So our first objective should be 
to destroy the sphere's control system.

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:06.190
In other words, this is our only chance.

00:11:06.190 --> 00:11:08.020
Exactly.

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:10.500
We'll use a diversion.

00:11:10.500 --> 00:11:14.260
While Joey and Heroman cause a 
commotion inside the factory,

00:11:14.260 --> 00:11:18.310
we'll head to the controls 
without drawing attention.

00:11:18.310 --> 00:11:19.220
Okay?

00:11:19.220 --> 00:11:19.920
Right.

00:11:19.920 --> 00:11:20.740
Got it.

00:11:21.690 --> 00:11:24.400
Oh, but before that...

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:25.880
Walkie-talkies.

00:11:26.500 --> 00:11:28.970
If something happens, contact us immediately.

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:31.340
Roger!

00:11:31.340 --> 00:11:33.330
All right, here we go.

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:35.380
Let's get this party started!

00:11:37.120 --> 00:11:38.200
Are you okay?

00:11:38.200 --> 00:11:40.930
Hold on tight, got it?

00:11:50.110 --> 00:11:51.430
Good.

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:54.390
We'll head that way.

00:11:54.390 --> 00:11:56.660
Joey... You head up.

00:11:56.660 --> 00:11:59.410
Right! Heroman, this way!

00:11:59.410 --> 00:12:01.280
See you later, Joey.

00:12:01.280 --> 00:12:03.080
You guys be careful!

00:12:03.080 --> 00:12:04.600
Same to you!

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:08.370
Lina, hurry up!

00:12:11.520 --> 00:12:13.530
Lina, where are you going?

00:12:13.530 --> 00:12:15.370
I'm going with Joey!

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:17.050
Why?

00:12:17.050 --> 00:12:20.180
Lina, wait! Lina!

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:22.320
Lina?

00:12:23.300 --> 00:12:26.210
I'm sure my brother and Nick will come for you!

00:12:32.200 --> 00:12:34.610
Please let me come with you!

00:12:34.970 --> 00:12:36.000
Okay.

00:12:39.690 --> 00:12:41.580
What are we going to do?

00:12:42.010 --> 00:12:45.730
If we're discovered then 
the plan's out the window.

00:12:45.730 --> 00:12:47.870
Let's leave this to Joey.

00:12:47.870 --> 00:12:49.140
Got you.

00:12:51.870 --> 00:12:53.530
Women...

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:59.910
Lord Kogorr, the white one has appeared.

00:12:59.910 --> 00:13:01.050
Its location?

00:13:01.050 --> 00:13:05.550
Inside the factory. It's in the underground.

00:13:05.550 --> 00:13:07.440
Here?

00:13:07.440 --> 00:13:08.720
Correct!

00:13:08.720 --> 00:13:13.280
To think they would actually 
invade our base themselves.

00:13:14.200 --> 00:13:16.780
Teach them how mistaken they are!

00:13:22.570 --> 00:13:23.980
It's them!

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:35.250
Heroman...

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:38.420
Attack!

00:13:49.510 --> 00:13:51.300
Okay, let's go!

00:14:01.100 --> 00:14:02.490
Will!

00:14:02.490 --> 00:14:04.710
Let's go, 02.

00:14:04.710 --> 00:14:07.000
I'll handle the white one.

00:14:07.000 --> 00:14:09.050
You get them.

00:14:12.360 --> 00:14:14.540
Will, Nick!

00:14:21.820 --> 00:14:23.850
Don't, Heroman!

00:14:23.850 --> 00:14:25.970
Don't hurt those two!

00:14:30.210 --> 00:14:31.940
Stop it, you two!

00:14:31.940 --> 00:14:33.020
Please!

00:14:39.430 --> 00:14:41.200
Professor Denton!

00:14:41.510 --> 00:14:44.390
<i>Joey? What's the matter?</i>

00:14:44.390 --> 00:14:46.280
Those two have shown up!

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:49.140
Really? Then follow the plan!

00:14:49.140 --> 00:14:50.590
Got it, Joey?

00:14:50.590 --> 00:14:51.710
<i>Right!</i>

00:14:52.750 --> 00:14:54.500
Let's go, Lina.

00:14:54.500 --> 00:14:55.240
What?

00:14:55.240 --> 00:14:59.510
The Professor said that Will and 
Nick are being mind-controlled.

00:14:59.510 --> 00:15:00.920
This is to break their control.

00:15:02.180 --> 00:15:05.290
They're being controlled by their helmets.

00:15:05.290 --> 00:15:06.800
You saw it too, Lina.

00:15:06.800 --> 00:15:10.600
We're pretending to run away 
now to get an opportunity!

00:15:12.430 --> 00:15:13.600
I get it.

00:15:24.480 --> 00:15:25.990
Heroman!

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:40.340
Joey! It looks like we can get through here.

00:15:55.270 --> 00:15:57.180
They're coming after us!

00:15:58.460 --> 00:15:59.610
Over here!

00:16:06.730 --> 00:16:07.810
This is...

00:16:07.810 --> 00:16:09.410
Joey, look!

00:16:11.460 --> 00:16:13.900
Is this where the spheres are made?

00:16:18.050 --> 00:16:20.060
Lina, you hide over there!

00:16:20.060 --> 00:16:21.410
Okay.

00:16:34.290 --> 00:16:37.850
The white one's friend has such power as well...

00:16:39.090 --> 00:16:43.200
But in the end you are still no match for us!

00:17:18.210 --> 00:17:20.010
This is it for you!

00:17:22.720 --> 00:17:24.900
Stop it!

00:17:31.840 --> 00:17:36.650
Please, Will! Go... Go back to normal!

00:17:38.900 --> 00:17:41.680
Don't make Lina sad!

00:17:41.680 --> 00:17:43.040
Please!

00:17:43.590 --> 00:17:45.750
Will!

00:17:52.550 --> 00:17:54.000
Brother, Brother!

00:17:54.000 --> 00:17:55.640
Heroman!

00:17:56.420 --> 00:17:57.850
Get the helmet!

00:18:01.480 --> 00:18:02.830
Brother...

00:18:04.830 --> 00:18:06.700
Please, enough!

00:18:06.700 --> 00:18:08.820
I'm begging you, come to your senses!

00:18:11.010 --> 00:18:14.570
Brother! Brother...

00:18:19.300 --> 00:18:20.880
Brother!

00:18:23.300 --> 00:18:26.500
Nick, everything's okay now. Snap out of it!

00:18:29.740 --> 00:18:31.300
I-I'm fine...

00:18:31.810 --> 00:18:34.840
No problems... at all!

00:18:41.090 --> 00:18:42.440
Joey!

00:18:45.930 --> 00:18:48.570
Joey, I remember now!

00:18:48.570 --> 00:18:50.280
Your name is Joey!

00:18:51.270 --> 00:18:53.190
And my name is Nick!

00:18:53.190 --> 00:18:55.150
Nick... Why?

00:18:55.150 --> 00:18:56.650
Why?

00:18:56.650 --> 00:18:59.670
You two are just being 
manipulated by the Skrugg!

00:18:59.670 --> 00:19:00.240
So...

00:19:00.480 --> 00:19:03.000
What are you talking about, Joey?

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:05.140
I've gotten power!

00:19:05.140 --> 00:19:07.460
I'm finally free!

00:19:10.920 --> 00:19:14.900
I've always sucked up to someone...

00:19:14.900 --> 00:19:19.460
and when other people noticed me 
I'd get scared for some reason!

00:19:19.460 --> 00:19:22.920
But I don't need to worry about that anymore!

00:19:22.920 --> 00:19:24.820
Do you understand why?

00:19:25.680 --> 00:19:26.920
It's power!

00:19:26.920 --> 00:19:28.410
Power!

00:19:28.410 --> 00:19:29.820
Power!

00:19:29.820 --> 00:19:32.480
As long as I have power I can do anything!

00:19:32.480 --> 00:19:36.170
I don't have to worry myself 
about that annoying crap anymore!

00:19:36.170 --> 00:19:40.200
I've finally become free!

00:19:42.070 --> 00:19:44.360
You're just like me, right?

00:19:44.360 --> 00:19:45.220
No!

00:19:45.220 --> 00:19:47.750
Sure, whatever.

00:19:47.750 --> 00:19:50.160
You should just disappear!

00:19:50.160 --> 00:19:50.920
Stop it!

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:54.360
You do this, and that'll be it!

00:19:54.360 --> 00:19:56.090
Do you understand, Nick?

00:19:56.090 --> 00:19:57.550
Give this up?

00:19:57.550 --> 00:19:59.540
You're wrong!

00:19:59.540 --> 00:20:00.920
Stop this already, Nick!

00:20:00.920 --> 00:20:05.340
Shut up! Don't order me around!

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:07.280
Lina!

00:20:10.530 --> 00:20:11.460
Will!

00:20:11.460 --> 00:20:12.610
Brother!

00:20:12.610 --> 00:20:14.770
Lina, you stay there.

00:20:14.770 --> 00:20:16.690
Open your eyes, Nick!

00:20:16.690 --> 00:20:19.020
Don't order me around!

00:20:19.020 --> 00:20:21.220
You still trying to be the boss?

00:20:21.220 --> 00:20:23.070
Nick, you're...

00:20:23.070 --> 00:20:25.430
You don't get it!

00:20:25.430 --> 00:20:27.920
We're not human anymore!

00:20:27.920 --> 00:20:30.510
We're Skrugg!

00:20:32.450 --> 00:20:33.410
What are you...

00:20:33.410 --> 00:20:35.640
Lina, stand back!

00:20:43.230 --> 00:20:45.480
Brother, are you okay?

00:20:45.480 --> 00:20:47.990
I'm sorry, Lina...

00:20:48.880 --> 00:20:50.920
But... I'm okay now.

00:20:50.920 --> 00:20:52.350
Thank goodness.

00:20:52.610 --> 00:20:57.100
Looks like the mind-control 
wasn't perfect after all.

00:20:57.100 --> 00:20:59.490
Y-Yes, it seems that way...

00:21:03.610 --> 00:21:06.290
I have no tolerance for failure.

00:21:06.290 --> 00:21:08.390
And that goes for all of you.

00:21:09.020 --> 00:21:12.440
Do it! Crush them all together!

00:21:12.440 --> 00:21:13.370
Yes, Lord!

00:21:17.290 --> 00:21:20.500
I won't let you anymore! I won't!

00:21:20.500 --> 00:21:23.510
You're nothing to me anymore!

00:21:23.510 --> 00:21:26.180
I'm not going to follow anyone's orders!

00:21:27.510 --> 00:21:30.780
And this all started with you, Will!

00:21:30.780 --> 00:21:32.390
This is your fault!

00:21:32.390 --> 00:21:34.860
This is all your fault!

00:21:37.210 --> 00:21:39.320
What? The roots?

00:21:39.320 --> 00:21:40.450
This is...

00:21:45.990 --> 00:21:47.550
The sphere!

00:21:47.550 --> 00:21:49.910
I'm free!

00:21:49.910 --> 00:21:53.080
I'm free!!

00:21:53.080 --> 00:21:54.330
Nick!

00:21:54.330 --> 00:21:55.830
Nick!

00:21:55.830 --> 00:21:57.770
It's dangerous here!

00:22:11.830 --> 00:22:14.310
<i>Joey... What happened?</i>

00:22:14.800 --> 00:22:16.290
<i>Joey!!</i>

00:22:20.690 --> 00:22:24.090
<b>"Can you hear this voice?"</b>

00:22:24.090 --> 00:22:31.560
<b>I've been calling that, always, from deep within my heart.</b>

00:22:34.370 --> 00:22:45.460
<b>Would you, all alone, let another lonely one be next to you?</b>

00:22:45.460 --> 00:22:51.010
<b>Because together it's not lonely, it's twoly.</b>

00:22:51.010 --> 00:22:56.140
<b>See, you're not alone any longer.</b>

00:22:57.280 --> 00:22:59.990
<b>Just because there's no one next to me</b>

00:22:59.990 --> 00:23:02.540
<b>doesn't mean that I'm lonely!</b>

00:23:02.540 --> 00:23:07.740
<b>For someone to notice this pain</b>

00:23:07.740 --> 00:23:13.270
<b>that heart must have surely cried.</b>

00:23:13.270 --> 00:23:16.650
<b>Right now, we'll crush to bits</b>

00:23:16.650 --> 00:23:20.350
<b>the fortress of our limitless sadness!</b>

00:23:20.350 --> 00:23:24.050
<b>I'll take you with me!</b>

00:23:24.050 --> 00:23:27.730
<b>Got it? I'm running through at full power.</b>

00:23:27.730 --> 00:23:31.470
<b>To where you're waiting, left behind</b>

00:23:31.470 --> 00:23:34.640
<b>in the place of tears...</b>

00:23:35.950 --> 00:23:39.770
<b>I believe in you, with burning passion!</b>

00:23:39.770 --> 00:23:43.560
<b>Come to me!</b>

00:23:51.100 --> 00:23:53.610
On the next Heroman:

00:23:53.610 --> 00:23:56.070
That's... Kogorr?

00:23:56.830 --> 00:24:00.780
Joey's group has broken into 
the center of the factory.

00:24:00.780 --> 00:24:06.890
Then before them, at last, appears 
the leader of the Skrugg, Kogorr.

00:24:06.890 --> 00:24:11.410
And the curtain rises on this 
spectacular decisive battle.

00:24:12.350 --> 00:24:15.630
Next time on Heroman #8: Combat.

00:24:15.970 --> 00:24:18.810
Heroman... Attack!
